"""
Tests for REQ-001: Runtime profile adapter layer with aws and onprem parity.

Test categories:
  1. Unit tests — adapter contract validation, registry profile selection,
     port interface compliance (no external services needed).
  2. Integration tests — object storage put/get round-trip against LocalStack
     (aws profile) and MinIO (onprem profile).  These require running
     containers and are marked with pytest markers so they can be skipped
     in environments without Docker.

Run all unit tests:
    DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=onprem python -m pytest test/ -v -m "not integration"

Run integration tests (requires docker-compose services):
    python -m pytest test/ -v -m integration
"""

